<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Constitution</h1>
<p>Constitution (CON) is one of your abilities: how tough your body is. It 
determines:
</p>
<ul><li><b>Your endurance.</b> Your maximum endurance grows with your constitution, and so does how fast it comes back (see <a cmd='#'>Help Endurance Points</a>).</li>
<li><b>How fast your hit points come back</b> when you rest or sleep. Your maximum hit points come from your hit point ability (HP), not from constitution.</li>
<li><b>Swimming.</b> Each time you swim, your swimming skill and your constitution decide whether you flounder and take in water (see <a cmd='#'>Help Swimming</a>).</li>
<li><b>Resisting plague</b>, together with your charisma.</li></ul>
<p>The spell constitution raises it for a while.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
